            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Walter Brattain's Early Life</strong><br>\nWalter Brattain was born in Amoy, China, on February 10, 1902. His parents were American teachers who taught abroad. When Walter was young, his family moved back to the United States, where he would spend most of his childhood in Washington state. Showing an interest in science early on, Walter excelled in his studies, which laid the groundwork for his later achievements in physics.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Academic Career</strong><br>\nBrattain pursued his passion for physics at Whitman College in Washington, where he received his undergraduate degree. He then went on to earn a master's degree from the University of Oregon and completed his Ph.D. at the University of Minnesota. After completing his doctorate, he joined Bell Laboratories, where he would contribute to the invention of the transistor.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Invention of the Transistor</strong><br>\nWorking with John Bardeen and William Shockley, Brattain was instrumental in inventing the point-contact transistor in 1947. This breakthrough allowed for the amplification and switching of electronic signals, which was more reliable and efficient than existing vacuum tube technology. The transistor revolutionized electronics and paved the way for modern computers and communications equipment.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
